{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink XT2 mounts address a concrete use for a camera I already own: positioning and protecting it, though three mounts are more than my one-camera kit needs.",
    "The Blink bundle and Fire TV Stick fit my interest in home security and streaming. The Echo Show also feels relevant to my connected home, even though none fills a clear need today."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The audio transmitter, optical cable, and speaker adapter solve connection problems I have not indicated I have; owning a television does not make those accessories useful to me now.",
    "The earbuds, speaker-and-bulb kit, and tablet introduce uses I am not currently pursuing. My recent purchases point more directly toward television viewing and camera setup."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to suggest more Amazon devices, even when their purpose differs from what I already use.",
    "My interest in home electronics seems to have been stretched into a general interest in audio equipment and accessories, regardless of whether they solve a specific problem."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I already have a Fire TV Stick 4K and a Fire TV television, so another streaming stick is familiar but largely duplicates what I own.",
    "An accessory that helps me use my existing Blink XT2 has a clearer purpose than a whole security bundle. More cameras would become appealing if I needed additional coverage."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my streaming and security interests but miss the difference between useful support for devices I own and additional equipment I do not currently need."
}"}
